  "Description": "AH-6J/MH-6J v1.2 recording-derived calibration. Requires Engine 1.8.0 and matching Hook. Uses direct phase-derived rotor data when available and an explicitly labelled engine-RPM proxy only when phase data is absent. Smooths ETL; strengthens hard touchdown, liftoff unloading, and grounded rotor loading without replacing individual-skid detail.",
